Proxmark3 FPGA bitstreams
=========================

Files:
  fpga_pm3_lf.bit   125 kHz LF reader gateware (Spartan-II XC2S30)
  fpga_pm3_hf.bit   13.56 MHz HF reader/sniffer gateware (Spartan-II XC2S30)

These are compiled FPGA bitstreams from the Proxmark3 project (Iceman fork),
https://github.com/RfidResearchGroup/proxmark3, licensed under GPL-3.0.

They are compiled artifacts of the Verilog sources in that project's fpga/
directory (also vendored in this tree at original_fw/proxmark3/fpga/*.v, e.g.
fpga_lf.v, fpga_hf.v, and the shared define.v / clk_divider.v). Per GPL-3.0,
the corresponding source is those Verilog files; rebuild with the Xilinx ISE
toolchain per the upstream fpga/Makefile.

The build (platforms/proxmark3/Makefile) LZSS-compresses these into
build/fpga/pm3_{lf,hf}.bit.z; the host streams them to /fpga on the device.
